{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-38702","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43929","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-38703","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43930","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-43931","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-43932","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-43933","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-43934","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-43935","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-43936","text":" markdown file across all 35 projects — plus each project's own root-level markdown, where TRVM, TRAAVIIS and WRL keep nearly all of theirs — becomes a page whose route *is* its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-43937","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-43938","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-38704","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43939","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-38705","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43940","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-43941","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-43942","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-43943","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-43944","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-43945","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-43946","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-38706","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43947","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-43948","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-43949","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-43950","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-43951","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-38707","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43952","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-38708","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43953","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-43954","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-43955","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-43956","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-38709","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43957","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-43958","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-43959","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-43960","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-43961","text":" scans the repo (excluding "},{"id":"spn-43962","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-43963","text":", "},{"id":"spn-43964","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-43965","text":", "},{"id":"spn-43966","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-43967","text":", "},{"id":"spn-43968","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-43969","text":", and every dot-directory except "},{"id":"spn-43970","marks":["code"],"text":".claude"},{"id":"spn-43971","text":", so gitignored local state like "},{"id":"spn-43972","marks":["code"],"text":".amp/"},{"id":"spn-43973","text":" is never published), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-43974","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-43975","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-43976","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-43977","text":" "},{"id":"spn-43978","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-43979","text":" file, each project's root-level markdown, and the top-level stack docs. 326 docs / 35 projects. 2. "},{"id":"spn-43980","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-43981","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-43982","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-43983","text":" parses the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-43984","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-43985","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-43986","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-43987","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes. 3. "},{"id":"spn-43988","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-43989","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-43990","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-43991","text":" links that resolve to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build). 4. "},{"id":"spn-43992","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-43993","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-43994","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-43995","text":" is checked to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-38710","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43996","text":"The campus *is* Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-43997","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-43998","text":" idea; the pages *are* BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-38711","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43999","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-38712","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44000","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-44001","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-44002","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-38713","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-44003","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-38714","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-38715","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44004","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-38716","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 326 real docs mirrored from 35 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 300 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-38717","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-44005","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-38718","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38720","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44006","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-44007","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-44008","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-44009","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-44010","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-44011","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-38719","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38721","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44012","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-38722","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38724","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44013","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-44014","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-44015","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-44016","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-44017","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-38723","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38725","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44018","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-44019","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-44020","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-38726","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-44021","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-38727","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38729","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44022","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-44023","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-38728","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44024","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-44025","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-38730","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38733","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44026","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-44027","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-38732","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38735","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44028","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-44029","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-38734","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38737","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44030","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-44031","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-44032","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-44033","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-38736","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38739","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44034","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-44035","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-44036","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-44037","text":", "},{"id":"spn-44038","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-44039","text":", "},{"id":"spn-44040","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-44041","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-38738","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38741","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44042","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-44043","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-44044","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-44045","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-44046","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-44047","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-38740","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierai7rvhdosamc6ogqjovwgyw2uityhnw7zz46exk6el7q6mkg54ega","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}